                "title": "FORM SLOT — delete this and drop in your form widget. Elementor Pro Form, WPForms or Contact Form 7; all three are styled identically by the stylesheet. Fields, in order: Your name (text, required) | Phone / WhatsApp (tel) | Interested in (select: Poultry / livestock feed line, Aqua & pet feed line, Biomass pellet line, Fertilizer plant (SSP / BOP / compost), Single machine, Automation / retrofit, Spares, Other) | Target capacity (text, placeholder 'e.g. 20 t/h') | Your message (textarea, placeholder 'Tell us about the site, raw material, timeline…'). Set the form's own submit button label to 'Send enquiry'.",
